graph TB
    subgraph Offline["Offline catalog tooling (CI / developer workstation, never deployed)"]
        Extractor["model-extractor<br/>Go CLI"]
        SRCatalog["serving-runtime-catalog<br/>Go CLI (--check mode in CI)"]
        SRValidate["serving-runtime-validate<br/>Go CLI"]
        Report["metadata-report<br/>Go CLI"]

        subgraph Pkgs["Internal Go packages"]
            HFPkg["internal/huggingface<br/>REST client"]
            GHPkg["internal/github<br/>API + raw client (5 MiB cap)"]
            RegPkg["internal/registry<br/>containers/image v5"]
            CatPkg["internal/catalog<br/>merge, dedup, schema validation"]
        end

        Tools["skopeo v1.22.0 / kustomize v5.8.1 / cosign v3.0.5<br/>subprocesses"]
        Schemas["Embedded model-registry schemas<br/>(go:embed)"]

        Extractor --> HFPkg
        Extractor --> GHPkg
        Extractor --> RegPkg
        Extractor --> CatPkg
        SRCatalog --> CatPkg
        CatPkg -->|exec| Tools
        SRValidate --> Schemas
    end

    subgraph Inputs["Checked-in inputs (git)"]
        InModels["input/models/collections/<br/>data/*-models-index.yaml"]
        InMCP["input/mcp_servers/<br/>redhat, partner, community"]
        InAgents["data/redhat-agents-index.yaml"]
        InSR["input/serving_runtimes/<br/>generator-config.yaml"]
    end

    subgraph Data["data/*.yaml (git, PR-reviewed)"]
        ValCat["validated-models-catalog.yaml<br/>100 models"]
        OtherCat["other-models-catalog.yaml<br/>44 models"]
        MCPCat["MCP server catalogs<br/>4 Red Hat / 5 partner / 3 community"]
        AgentCat["redhat-agents-catalog.yaml<br/>14 agents"]
        SRCat["redhat-serving-runtimes-catalog.yaml<br/>24 ServingRuntime Templates"]
    end

    InModels --> Extractor
    InMCP --> Extractor
    InAgents --> Extractor
    InSR --> SRCatalog

    Extractor -->|writes| ValCat
    Extractor -->|writes| OtherCat
    Extractor -->|writes| MCPCat
    Extractor -->|writes| AgentCat
    SRCatalog -->|writes| SRCat
    SRValidate -->|validates| SRCat
    Report -->|reports on| ValCat

    subgraph Shipped["Shipped artifact (RHOAI)"]
        Image["odh-model-metadata-collection-rhel9<br/>Dockerfile.konflux<br/>ubi9/ubi-minimal-pqc (digest-pinned)<br/>VOLUME /app/data, UID 1001<br/>CMD sleep infinity, no ports"]
    end

    Upstream["Upstream ODH image<br/>Dockerfile, ubi9-micro:latest<br/>+ /app/benchmarks"]

    Data -->|"COPY data/*.yaml (Konflux build)"| Image
    Data -.->|GitHub Actions build| Upstream

    MR["model-registry catalog service<br/>(Model Catalog / MCP Catalog)"]
    Operator["rhods-operator /<br/>model-registry-operator"]
    Dashboard["odh-dashboard"]

    Operator -.->|"deploys image, configures<br/>catalog source paths (inferred)"| Image
    Image -->|"/app/data volume mount (inferred)"| MR
    MR -.->|catalog content| Dashboard

    HF["HuggingFace Hub"]
    GH["GitHub API / raw"]
    RHReg["registry.redhat.io"]
    HFPkg -->|HTTPS/443| HF
    GHPkg -->|HTTPS/443| GH
    RegPkg -->|HTTPS/443| RHReg
    Tools -->|HTTPS/443| RHReg

